CHAPTER.VERS:
And your

          {+}
         spoil will be gathered [as] the caterpillar gathers: as locusts leap will men leap on it.

You

          {+}
         will be pregnant with chaff, you

          {+}
         will give birth to stubble: your

          {+}
         breath is a fire that will devour you

          {+}
        .

Hear, you

          {+}
         who are far off, what I have done; and, you

          {+}
         who are near, acknowledge my might.
